  S([Student])
  CL([Club leader])
  O([Organiser])
  A([Administrator])
  CH[ITC Club Hub]
  MAIL[[E-mail service]]
  DIR[[ITC student directory]]

  S -->|browse, register, cancel| CH
  CH -->|event list, registration status| S
  CL -->|club application, event details, capacity| CH
  CH -->|approval status, attendee list| CL
  O -->|check-in scans, attendance updates| CH
  CH -->|attendee roster, check-in results| O
  A -->|club approval or rejection, report request| CH
  CH -->|pending clubs, monthly activity report| A
  CH -->|confirmation and reminder requests| MAIL
  MAIL -->|confirmation and reminder e-mails| S
  CH -->|student ID lookup request| DIR
  DIR -->|student name and e-mail, lookup result| CH